  ✓ final text passes guard (0 residual)
--- reply ---
I'm sorry to hear about your family member 🙏 This is hard.

You can start reciting for them right away:

📿 **Great Compassion Mantra (Ta Pei Chou)** — 7 times a day
Before reciting, say:
*"May the Great Merciful and Great Compassionate Guan Yin Bodhisattva protect and bless [family member's full name], grant them good health and cure their illness in [part of the body]."*

Master Lu's teaching on this is very clear:

> For patients, it is best to recite the Great Compassion Mantra (Ta Pei Chou) as much as possible for as long as possible.

Two important cautions from Master Lu:
- If **the patient themselves** recites, they should recite **only the Great Compassion Mantra** — not the Heart Sutra or the Amitabha Pure Land Rebirth Mantra, because they are physically weak.
- Once their condition has stabilised, the Great Compassion Mantra can be increased to **49 times per day**.

Also — please keep following the doctors' treatment. Master Lu always taught body and mind together: recitation clears the spiritual obstacles, medicine treats the body. Both hands working.

If you don't know how to recite yet, there are teaching videos you can follow along with:
🔗 https://xinlingfamen.info/jingwen/

One question so I can guide you better — **have you recited sutras before, or is this completely new to you?**

